batch_validate_iban: outputSchema  parameters: -IL and MN; +IL, MN and RU;
check_compliance: outputSchema  parameters: -IL and MN; +IL, MN and RU;
validate_iban: outputSchema  parameters: -IL and MN; +IL, MN and RU;

falpha_signal_desk_card: description  -short), the signal's risk-adjusted track record (the Sharpe ratio, Sortino ratio and share of positive periods of the signal's past readings for this ticker, horizon and regime), +short) -reading, with +reading for the requested horizon and regime, the direction and EI at all three horizons for that regime (`horizons`), and +The card view's Horizon and Regime controls switch the reading in place.
falpha_signal_desk_curve: description  -drivers or track record; +drivers;
falpha_signal_desk_performance: description  -forecast and not the signal's track record (that is on the signal card). +forecast.
